    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Campbells Auctioneers are delighted to bring this Two Bedroom Cottage situated in Keadue, Burtonport, Co. Donegal to the open market.\n\nOccupying a peaceful rural setting on approximately 3.3 acres, the property is conveniently located within easy reach of Burtonport Village and the many amenities and attractions this popular coastal area has to offer.\n\nThe accommodation is neatly arranged throughout and comprises an Entrance Hall, Hallway, Living Room, Kitchen, Two Bedrooms and Bathroom.\n\nThe property offers an excellent opportunity for those seeking a traditional cottage in a quiet Donegal setting, whether as a Permanent Residence, Holiday Home or Countryside Retreat.\n\nIts location provides a great base from which to enjoy the surrounding Donegal coastline, with beaches, scenic walks and local villages all within easy reach.\n\nViewing comes Highly Recommended and by STRICT Appointment Only with Campbells Auctioneers.\n\n\nOur Ref: K1286\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 1.32m (4'4\") x 1.09m (3'7\")\nLinoleum Floor\n\nHallway - 3.92m (12'10\") x 0.95m (3'1\")\nLinoleum Floor\n\nLiving Room - 3.92m (12'10\") x 3.41m (11'2\")\nCarpeted, Open Fire\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.52m (11'7\") x 3.39m (11'1\")\nCarpeted\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.19m (7'2\") x 1.94m (6'4\")\nCarpeted\n\nBathroom - 2.01m (6'7\") x 1.52m (5'0\")\nFully Tiled, Sink, Shower, Hand Basin, Toilet\n\nKitchen - 5.05m (16'7\") x 2.43m (8'0\")\nLinoleum Floor\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
